<title>BELGIUM: TABLE - Telinfo H1 net rises 26 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Telinfo H1 net rises 26 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit		 143  vs   113</p>
<p>    Pretax current profit	  166  vs   157</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 185  vs   183</p>
<p>    Turnover			 3,669  vs 3,154</p>
<p>    Cash flow			  304  vs   284</p>
<p>NOTE - Telfino is a Belgian data communications company.  It</p>
<p>provided the following geographical breakdown (in percent) of</p>
<p>its turnover</p>
<p>Benelux				  80   vs   75</p>
<p>European Union (ex Benelux)	18   vs   19</p>
<p>Ex-EU				    2    vs   6</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
